:{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1605422/d33cfffb-c700-45a0-90ae-1fb7177a6780.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1605422/d33cfffb-c700-45a0-90ae-1fb7177a6780.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1605422/d33cfffb-c700-45a0-90ae-1fb7177a6780.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1605422/d33cfffb-c700-45a0-90ae-1fb7177a6780.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}},{"originalLink":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1605422/07f82839-7895-4c84-bb7d-e8298086dbeb.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":null,"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1605422/07f82839-7895-4c84-bb7d-e8298086dbeb.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1605422/07f82839-7895-4c84-bb7d-e8298086dbeb.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1605422/07f82839-7895-4c84-bb7d-e8298086dbeb.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1605422/07f82839-7895-4c84-bb7d-e8298086dbeb.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1605422/07f82839-7895-4c84-bb7d-e8298086dbeb.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"45 m2, 2 Zimmer · Parkplatz · 10 Minuten nach Tübingen\n\nMöblierte Dachwohnung mit 45 m2, zwei Zimmern und eigenem Parkplatz am Haus. Zugeschnitten auf eine Person oder ein Paar, das für ein paar Monate hier arbeitet. Bezugsfertig ab dem ersten Tag – Bettwäsche, Handtücher, Küchenausstattung und eine Waschtrockner-Kombination in der Wohnung.\n\nIn der Monatsmiete enthalten sind Strom, Heizung, Wasser, Internet und der Rundfunkbeitrag. Keine Nebenkostenabrechnung im Nachgang. Einmalig fällt die Endreinigung an.\n\nAnmeldung ist möglich. Sie erhalten eine Wohnungsgeberbestätigung, Briefkasten und Klingel werden auf Ihren Namen beschriftet.\n\nZum Arbeiten eingerichtet: fester Arbeitsplatz und Starlink-Internet mit 100 Mbit/s – auf dem Land keine Selbstverständlichkeit. Ruhige Lage im Dachgeschoss.\n\nAngenehm im Sommer: keine Split-Klimaanlage, sondern eine Wärmepumpe mit Kühlung über die Fußbodenheizung. Kaltes Wasser im Estrich – lautlos, kein Luftzug, keine trockene Luft. Beschattung an allen Fenstern.\n\nWege: Tübingen 10 Minuten, Reutlingen 15, Stuttgart 25–30, Flughafen und Messe Stuttgart 20 – mit dem Auto über die B27. Der Bahnhof Kirchentellinsfurt ist 6 Minuten zu Fuß entfernt (RE10 Mannheim–Tübingen, RB63 Herrenberg–Bad Urach).\n\nZwei Dinge vorab: Die Zufahrt zum Haus ist steil und schmal, links begrenzt von einer Steinmauer. Und wir vermieten maximal fünf Monate am Stück – für eine dauerhafte Wohnung sind wir der falsche Anbieter.\n\nRauchen und Haustiere sind im ganzen Objekt nicht erlaubt (Rücksicht auf Allergiker).\n\n——— English ———\n\nFurnished attic flat of 45 m2 with two rooms and its own parking space at the house. Cut for one person or a couple working here for a few months. Ready to move into from day one – bed linen, towels, kitchen equipment and a washer-dryer in the flat.\n\nThe monthly rent includes electricity, heating, water, internet and the German broadcasting fee. No utility bill afterwards. A one-off final cleaning fee applies.\n\nYou can register at this address (Anmeldung). You will receive a Wohnungsgeberbestätigung, and the mailbox and doorbell will carry your name.\n\nSet up for work: a proper desk and Starlink internet at 100 Mbit/s – not a given in the countryside. Quiet top-floor location.\n\nComfortable in summer: no split air conditioning, but a heat pump that cools through the underfloor heating – silent, no draught, no dry air. All windows have blinds.\n\nGetting around: Tübingen 10 minutes, Reutlingen 15, Stuttgart 25–30, Stuttgart airport and trade fair 20 – by car via the B27. Kirchentellinsfurt station is a 6-minute walk away (RE10 Mannheim–Tübingen, RB63 Herrenberg–Bad Urach).\n\nTwo things up front: the driveway up to the house is steep and narrow, bounded on the left by a stone wall. And we rent for a maximum of five months at a time – if you are looking for a permanent home, we are the wrong address.\n\nSmoking and pets are not allowed anywhere on the property.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"no"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"other"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"no"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"45"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":189900,"deposit":180000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"1899.00","deposit":"1800.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":1,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":25,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-09-27"}],"updated":"2026-09-11T02:12:58Z","__utId__":"ut1605422"}]